Perform RMOD Power Off And Verify Alarms and Statuses
    [Documentation]    Performs RMOD power OFF and verifies alarms and statuses of all components after RMOD startup.
    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${rmod_serial_number}
    ...            ${connection}
    ...            ${bts_type}
    
    ${impacted_rmod_ids}=                                   utilities.convert_to_list
    ...                                                     ${rmod_id}

    Allow Alarms Before Power Off Rmods                     rmod_ids=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    
    Robot Log Step                                          Performing RMOD power OFF on RMOD-${rmod_id}.    
    power.turn_off_device                                   serial_number=${rmod_serial_number}
    
    Robot Log Step                                          Waiting for 'No connection to unit' alarm to become active...
    ${is_alarm_active}=                                     Wait for active alarm
    ...                                                     timeout=300
    ...                                                     fault_name=No connection to unit
    ...                                                     fault_id=10
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    Should Be True                                          ${is_alarm_active}
    ...                                                     msg='No connection to unit' alarm is not active
    
    Sleep                                                   30s
    ...                                                     msg=Wait 30sec before FID 10 count check... 
    Check number of active alarms                           expected_number_of_alarms=1
    ...                                                     fault_id=10
    ...                                                     fault_name=No connection to unit
    ...                                                     bts_type=GNB

    Robot Log Step                                          Verifying statuses of all BBMODs and RMODs after RMOD power OFF... 
    Verify All BBMODs Statuses and Their Resources with Impacted BBMODs and RMODs
    ...                                                     impacted_bbmod_ids=@{EMPTY}
    ...                                                     impacted_bbmods_status_variant=${None}
    ...                                                     impacted_rmods_ids=${impacted_rmod_ids}
    ...                                                     impacted_rmods_status_variant=disabled
    ...                                                     impacted_cells_status_variant=failed
    ...                                                     skip_cells_verification=${False}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

Perform RMOD Power On And Verify Alarms and Statuses
    [Documentation]    Performs RMOD power ON and verifies alarms and statuses of all components after RMOD startup.
    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${rmod_serial_number}
    ...            ${connection}
    ...            ${bts_type}
    ...            ${fault_name}
    ...            ${fault_id}
    ...            ${expected_fault_signature}
    ...            ${fault_activation_timeout}
    ...            ${fault_inactivation_timeout}
    
    Robot Log Step                                          Performing RMOD power ON on RMOD-${rmod_id}.
    power.turn_on_device                                    serial_number=${rmod_serial_number}
    
    Robot Log Step                                          Waiting for 'No connection to unit' alarm to become inactive...
    ${is_alarm_inactive}=                                   Wait For Inactive Alarm
    ...                                                     timeout=300
    ...                                                     fault_name=No connection to unit
    ...                                                     fault_id=10
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    Should Be True                                          ${is_alarm_inactive}
    ...                                                     msg='No connection to unit' alarm is still active

    Robot Log Step                                          Waiting for alarm '${fault_name}' (FID: '${fault_id}') activation...
    Wait for active alarm                                   timeout=${fault_activation_timeout}
    ...                                                     fault_name=${fault_name}
    ...                                                     fault_id=${fault_id}
    ...                                                     fault_signature=${expected_fault_signature}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Run keyword if    """${expected_fault_signature}"""!="""${None}"""
    ...                                                     Run keywords
    ...                                                     Robot Log Operation
    ...                                                     Verifying Date and Reset Counter in Fault Signature...
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Verify Date and Reset Counter in Fault Signature Not Empty
    ...                                                     fault_id=${fault_id}
    ...                                                     fault_name=${fault_name}

    Robot Log Step                                          Waiting for alarm '${fault_name}' (FID: '${fault_id}') inactivation...
    Wait for inactive alarm                                 timeout=${fault_inactivation_timeout}
    ...                                                     fault_name=${fault_name}
    ...                                                     fault_id=${fault_id}
    ...                                                     fault_signature=${expected_fault_signature}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    
    Sleep                                                   30s
    ...                                                     msg=Wait 30sec before FID 10 count check... 
    Check number of active alarms                           expected_number_of_alarms=0
    ...                                                     fault_id=10
    ...                                                     fault_name=No connection to unit
    ...                                                     bts_type=GNB
    
    Disallow Alarms After RMOD Power ON                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot Log Step                                          Verifying statuses of all BBMODs and RMODs after RMOD power ON... 
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             3min
    ...                                                     30s
    ...                                                     Check all BBMODs and RMODs
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             5min
    ...                                                     30s
    ...                                                     Check statuses of all cells
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

Power Reset Teardown
    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${connection}
    ...            ${bts_type}

    Robot Log Step                                      Performing test teardown...
    ${rmod_serial_number}=                              admin_info_model.get_serial_number_for_rmod
    ...                                                 rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    Robot Log Operation                                 RMOD power ON and waiting for online status...
    power.turn_on_device                                serial_number=${rmod_serial_number}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                         5min
    ...                                                 10s
    ...                                                 status_check.verify_statuses_of_rmod
    ...                                                 rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                 status_variant=online
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    
    Robot Log Operation                                 Waiting for BTS OnAir status...
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                         5min
    ...                                                 30s
    ...                                                 Check BTS state and all RATs states
    ...                                                 bts_type=${bts_type}
